---
// Reusable footer component
---

<footer class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-20 md:mt-32 mb-24 md:mb-32">
    <div class="brutal-card bg-black text-white p-8 md:p-20 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-8">
                <div class="max-w-2xl">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl mb-6 tracking-tighter uppercase italic leading-none">Conecta y
                        <br><span class="text-acid">Pide Temas</span></h2>
                    <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold mb-8 opacity-80">¿Quieres que analicemos algo
                        específico? ¿Tienes una duda existencial sobre IA o Startups? ¡Escríbenos!</p>

                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ctala/" target="_blank"
                        class="brutal-btn bg-acid hover:bg-white text-sm md:text-lg mb-4 w-full md:w-auto md:mr-4">
                        Proponer Tema
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 w-full md:w-auto">
                    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-black opacity-50 mb-2">Perfiles de LinkedIn:
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ctala/" target="_blank"
                        class="hover:text-acid flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2 transition-all group min-w-[200px]">
                        <span class="font-bold">Cristian Tala</span> <span
                            class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">↗</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rodrigorojo/" target="_blank"
                        class="hover:text-acid flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2 transition-all group min-w-[200px]">
                        <span class="font-bold">Rodrigo Rojo</span> <span
                            class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">↗</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/godiegoarias/" target="_blank"
                        class="hover:text-acid flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-800 pb-2 transition-all group min-w-[200px]">
                        <span class="font-bold">Diego Arias</span> <span
                            class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">↗</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute right-[-30px] bottom-[-30px] md:right-[-50px] md:bottom-[-50px] text-[10rem] md:text-[20rem] font-black opacity-10 leading-none select-none pointer-events-none">
            TOPIC
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <div class="font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">
            Es la hora de aprender • 2026 • Santiago de Chile
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 opacity-50">
            Build v2.1.2 • Feb 18, 2026 10:30 AM
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
